{#
    One person to ring, the way /admin/scans writes it everywhere: the name — a link to the
    resident's card, plain text for the gate's login (it is refused at that card) — and the
    phone as a tel: link for everybody who reads the page (Иван, 12.11.2026). «—» when
    there is nobody. Name and phone come from GuardService (`contact_name`, `contact_phone`),
    the same as the bot's «Контакт власника», so the panel and the bot cannot disagree; the
    live passes' «Видав» and every feed line draw it from here.
#}
{%- if person -%}
    {%- set name = person|contact_name -%}
    {%- set phone = person|contact_phone -%}
    {%- if name != '—' and not guard_only|default(false) -%}<a href="{{ path('app_admin_resident', {id: person.id}) }}" class="text-decoration-none">{{ name }}</a>{%- else -%}{{ name }}{%- endif %}
    <span class="text-nowrap">({% if phone != '—' %}<a href="tel:{{ phone }}">{{ phone }}</a>{% else %}—{% endif %})</span>
{%- else -%}
    —
{%- endif -%}
